# The virtual console on the screen (/devices/framebuffer and
# /devices/keyboard): flux on a session pair. It takes the screen from
# the boot splash (screen = yes: the splash is told to quit first, leaving
# its picture until the console draws). Without a display it ends at once
# and is not started again. Disabled: the desktop (desktop.service,
# kepler) has the screen; `impulsectl start console` runs it
# anyway, or disable the desktop and enable this one.
description = mlx-console on the screen
disabled = yes
exec = mlx-console
screen = yes
restart = on-failure
after = serial-shell
